@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
title UC-08 完成临床就诊
actor "牙医" as dentist
boundary "就诊界面" as screen
control "就诊控制器" as control
entity "临床就诊" as visit
entity "预约" as booking
dentist -> screen: 请求完成(记录版本)
screen -> control: 完成就诊(就诊号、版本)
control -> visit: 核对风险、治疗与签署()
visit --> control: 返回完整性结果
alt [有待处理缺项]
control --> screen: 返回缺失项目
screen --> dentist: 显示待补录项
else [条件完整且版本一致]
control -> visit: 完成(期望版本)
visit --> control: 完成时间与版本
control -> booking: 标记完成(时间)
booking --> control: 状态更新结果
control --> screen: 返回完成结果
screen --> dentist: 显示完成结果
end
@enduml
